                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The CLI's accept has no host guard — the UI is the guard it lacks: fingerprint match against policy.HOST gates the run button; below the bar the mode degrades to a copyable docker command, never a button. Recovery after a bad accept: git checkout -- __baselines__/ && git clean -fd __baselines__/.",
